## Endpoints

### Auth Flow (2)
- `GET /uc/finance/cosaic/temporaryAssets/{temporaryAssetToken}` — Get temporary asset data.
- `GET /v1/test/getcrumb` — Get a crumb for authentication.

### Data Read (9)
- `GET /api/v1/dsync/yahoo` — Get data from Yahoo's DSync service.
- `GET /ups/{upId}/sync` — Synchronize user profile data.
- `GET /v1/consentRecord` — Get user consent record.
- `GET /v1/finance/quoteType/` — Get quote type information.
- `GET /v1/finance/screener/predefined/saved` — Get saved screener definitions.
- `GET /v7/finance/quote` — Get stock quote data.
- `GET /v8/finance/chart/GME` — Get chart data for a specific symbol (e.g., GME).
- `GET /xhr/i18n` — Get internationalization (i18n) data.
- `POST /v2/public/yql` — Query data using YQL.

### Data Write (2)
- `POST /{id}` — Create or update data for a specific ID.
- `POST /v1/finance/visualization` — Create or update a finance visualization.

### Realtime (2)
- `GET /ws/fundamentals-timeseries/v1/finance/timeseries/GME` — Get fundamentals timeseries data for a symbol (e.g., GME).
- `GET /ws/screeners/v1/finance/calendar-events` — Get calendar events related to finance.

### Config (1)
- `GET /eh/prebid-config/{prebid-configId}` — Get prebid configuration.

### Core API (3)
- `POST /admax/bid/partners/YPBJS` — Submit a bid to AdMax.
- `POST /nimbus_ms/remote` — Execute a remote Nimbus microservice call.
- `POST /openrtb2/auction` — Participate in an OpenRTB auction.

